  "description": "Plugins for TIFY (tify@0.36.2), the slim IIIF document viewer, published as individual npm modules under @projektemacher/tify-plugin-*: a custom metadata side panel, OpenSeadragon overlays synced to pages (TEI word boxes or demo markers), HDR canvas status, per-tile C2PA provenance, display-only Annotorious annotations, and rendered MusicXML scores with playback. All panels dock into the TIFY viewer chrome.",
